{"id":"n78288-3-7","stage":5,"title":"찰칵 · 咔嗒","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n78288-3-7-1","ko":"이게 무슨 소리예요?","zh":"这是什么声音啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이게","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이것：这个；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이것","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44878","senseId":"1","lemma":"이것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이게","audio":"/audio/080ef3b94e3a9d861970.mp3"}},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"3","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}},{"text":"소리예요?","meaning":"声音，声，音，动静","explanation":"소리：声音，声，音，动静；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"소리","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62379","senseId":"1","lemma":"소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소리예요","audio":"/audio/f5a2d2fa9c0af8a34714.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e414d84c28c86213","term":"이것","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3","entryId":"44878","definition":"指代与说话人较近或说话人所想的东西。","pronunciation":["이걷"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"用于强调预料之外的、不合理的事情。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"d13cec79f66edb6a","term":"소리","zh":"声音，声，音，动静","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3","entryId":"62379","definition":"物体震动发出的音波传入耳朵中产生的响声。","pronunciation":["소리"]}],"audio":"/audio/cf3f5ccb32aa54177088.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n78288-3-7-2","ko":"아이가 자석을 찰칵 붙이면서 노는 소리예요.","zh":"是孩子把磁铁啪嗒啪嗒地贴来贴去玩耍的声音。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아이가","meaning":"小孩，孩子","explanation":"아이：小孩，孩子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아이가","audio":"/audio/820c647554b7d3f4fc3a.mp3"}},{"text":"자석을","meaning":"磁铁，磁石","explanation":"자석：磁铁，磁石；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"자석","audio":"/audio/f9de6932615017c19abf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73834","senseId":"2","lemma":"자석","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자석을","audio":"/audio/6e61c713c8cd0f7d0a84.mp3"}},{"text":"찰칵","meaning":"咔嗒","explanation":"찰칵：咔嗒","readings":[{"term":"찰칵","audio":"/audio/0b065c3bd3da4912f1a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78288","senseId":"3","lemma":"찰칵","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찰칵","audio":"/audio/0b065c3bd3da4912f1a8.mp3"}},{"text":"붙이면서","meaning":"粘，贴，粘贴","explanation":"붙이다：粘，贴，粘贴；면서：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"붙이다","audio":"/audio/f50e3cbdb3c8dd13b787.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60293","senseId":"1","lemma":"붙이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"붙이면서","audio":"/audio/13251a0d54d959079f37.mp3"}},{"text":"노는","meaning":"玩耍，玩乐","explanation":"놀다：玩耍，玩乐；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88353","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"노는","audio":"/audio/ef98057cc8ad0bc9fbfc.mp3"}},{"text":"소리예요.","meaning":"声音，声，音，动静","explanation":"소리：声音，声，音，动静；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"소리","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62379","senseId":"1","lemma":"소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소리예요","audio":"/audio/f5a2d2fa9c0af8a34714.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"小孩，孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["아이"]},{"id":"f9de6932615017c1","term":"자석","zh":